        "start": 379236,
        "text": "Help support Saint Demetrios Greek Orthodox Church by donating or sharing with your friends."
      },
      {
        "start": 387403,
        "text": "St. Demetrios Vesper Service - 6:30pm"
      },
      {
        "start": 388110,
        "text": "Demetrios the Myrrh-streamer & Great Martyr of Thessaloniki"
      },
      {
        "start": 389786,
        "text": "\u29eb Celebrating 98 Years of St. Demetrios! Our annual dance is on Friday, October 23rd at 7pm in the church hall. Contact the church office for tickets. See flyer for details. We hope to see everyone there!"
      },
      {
        "start": 402647,
        "text": "The Young Adult League (YAL) is dedicated to helping young adults (ages 18-35) deepen their faith and become active members of the Church community. The group is more than just a social group but a ministry that gathers in faith, fellowship, witness, and service to deepen their relationship with Christ. To get involved, please see our contact information below: Instagram: @stdemetriosunion_yal GroupMe: St. Demetrios Union YAL Email:"
      },
      {
        "start": 403380,
        "text": "GrStDemetriosUnion@hotmail.com"
      },
      {
        "start": 405696,
        "text": "As we move forward into the year, we warmly encourage every household to renew their St. Demetrios Church membership for 2026. Your membership is not just a formality\u2014it is a powerful expression of faith, unity, and commitment to the life of our parish."
      },
      {
        "start": 411940,
        "text": "Donate to Saint Demetrios Greek Orthodox Church"
      },
